<mxCell id="e6" value="jenis = 'Penerimaan Piutang'" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endFill=0;startFill=0;startArrow=ERmandOne;endArrow=ERoneToMany;exitX=0.5;exitY=0;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=1;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#555555;" edge="1" parent="1" source="pp" target="jur"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell>
<mxCell id="legend" value="&lt;b&gt;Legenda&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;PK&lt;/b&gt; primary key, &lt;b&gt;UK&lt;/b&gt; unique, &lt;b&gt;FK&lt;/b&gt; foreign key (relasi logis). Abu-abu: tabel penjualan / plan tagih. Putih: transaksi finance. Biru: jurnal bersama.&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#8E44AD&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Ungu (*)&lt;/b&gt;: isi baru untuk UMKM, tanpa perubahan skema:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;tax_treatment&lt;/b&gt; = 'UMKM': DPP tetap 11/12, PPN 0, total tagihan = saldo piutang awal = penjualan.&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;pph23_dipotong&lt;/b&gt; Y = PPh Final 0,5% dipotong customer, N = disetor sendiri (PKP/WAPU/KB tetap PPh 23 2%).&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;pph23&lt;/b&gt; detail = PPh Final yang dipotong customer (invoice UMKM).&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;consulting_snapshot&lt;/b&gt; penerimaan (calculation_version 4) + &lt;b&gt;pph_final_self&lt;/b&gt; = PPh Final disetor sendiri.&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;tr_jurnal&lt;/b&gt;: baris Beban PPh Final (D) / Hutang PPh Final (K) dengan coa kosong sampai konstanta Consulting_receipt::PPH_FINAL_*_COA diisi; posting ditolak selama coa kosong.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Relasi polimorfik&lt;/b&gt;: tr_jurnal.no_transaksi menunjuk tr_invoicing.id atau tr_penerimaan_piutang.no_surat, tergantung jenis_transaksi.&lt;br&gt;Modul Penerimaan PPh 23 tidak membaca detail consulting_version 3, jadi PPh Final UMKM tidak muncul sebagai bukti potong PPh 23.&lt;br&gt;Company di Invoicing hanya STM, Vuca, Sustain." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=11;fillColor=#FAFAFA;strokeColor=#CCCCCC;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="470" width="780" height="175" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
</root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>
